// TestFormalConformance replays the cases that the Lean model in
// formal/c1z emits through `lake exe c1z-oracle` (regenerated by
// `make formal-c1z-oracle`) against this engine. The JSON contract is
// formal/c1z/ORACLE_SCHEMA.md.
//
// The container family drives the public store API in pkg/dotc1z, which
// imports this package, so it cannot be replayed here. This file decodes
// it as raw JSON for the counts check; TestFormalContainer and
// TestFormalContainerProperty in pkg/dotc1z/formal_container_test.go
// replay it.
